Package: projCorr
Type: Package
Title: Projection Correlation Independence Tests
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Wang", role = "aut"),
    person("Chia", email = "xzm1@ruc.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Implements the projection correlation independence test of Zhu
    et al. (2017), and the improved projection correlation and refitted
    cross-validation tests of Zhang and Zhu (2024). The package keeps the
    dependence estimates, test statistics, and p-value calibration explicit.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    Rcpp,
    stats
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 7.3.3
SystemRequirements: C++17, optional OpenMP
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
